cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below, and cite the dataset it produced."
title: "ACTRIS/EARLINET Level 3 aerosol profiling climatology"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/actris-ares/actris-earlinet-level3-aerosol-profiling-climatology"
abstract: >-
  R code that produces the ACTRIS/EARLINET Level 3 aerosol profiling climatology from Level 2
  lidar data: monthly, seasonal and annual statistics of the aerosol optical profiles, of the
  integrated quantities and of the aerosol layers for each station, written as NetCDF files
  that follow the ACTRIS conventions. It produced the ACTRIS/EARLINET Level 3 2000-2021
  climatological dataset.
keywords:
  - ACTRIS
  - EARLINET
  - aerosol
  - lidar
  - climatology
  - Level 3
  - NetCDF
  - R
